#: ../../source/installation/index.rst:3
#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:37
#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:228
#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:20
#: ../../source/installation/worker_mode.rst:92
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "설치"

#: ../../source/installation/index.rst:5
msgid ""
"CodeIgniter has two supported installation methods: manual download, or "
"using `Composer <https://getcomposer.org>`_. Which is right for you?"
msgstr ""
"CodeIgniter는 두 가지 지원되는 설치 방법을 제공합니다: 수동 다운로드 또는 `Composer "
"<https://getcomposer.org>`_ 사용. 어떤 방법이 여러분에게 적합할까요?"

#: ../../source/installation/index.rst:9
msgid ""
"We recommend the Composer installation because it keeps CodeIgniter up to "
"date easily."
msgstr "CodeIgniter를 최신 상태로 쉽게 유지할 수 있기 때문에 Composer 설치를 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/index.rst:10
msgid ""
"If you would like the simple \"download & go\" install that CodeIgniter 3 is"
" known for, choose the manual installation."
msgstr ""
"CodeIgniter 3의 특징인 간단한 \"다운로드 및 실행(download & go)\" 설치를 원한다면 수동 설치를 선택하세요."

#: ../../source/installation/index.rst:13
msgid ""
"However you choose to install and run CodeIgniter4, the latest `user guide "
"<https://codeigniter.com/user_guide/>`_ is accessible online. If you want to"
" see previous versions, you can download from the `codeigniter4/userguide "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/userguide/releases>`_ repository."
msgstr ""
"CodeIgniter 4를 설치하고 실행하는 방법에 상관없이 최신 `사용자 가이드 "
"<https://codeigniter.com/user_guide/>`_\\ 는 온라인에서 볼 수 있습니다. 이전 버전을 확인하려면 "
"`codeigniter4/userguide "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/userguide/releases>`_ 저장소에서 다운로드할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/index.rst:19
msgid ""
"Before using CodeIgniter 4, make sure that your server meets the "
":doc:`requirements </intro/requirements>`, in particular the PHP version and"
" the PHP extensions that are needed. You may find that you have to uncomment"
" the ``php.ini`` \"extension\" lines to enable \"curl\" and \"intl\", for "
"instance."
msgstr ""
"CodeIgniter 4를 사용하기 전에 서버가 :doc:`요구 사항 </intro/requirements>`, 특히 필요한 PHP 버전"
" 및 PHP 확장 기능을 충족하는지 확인하세요. 예를 들어, \"curl\" 및 \"intl\"을 활성화하려면 ``php.ini``\\ "
"의 \"extension\" 줄의 주석을 제거해야 할 수도 있습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:2
msgid "Composer Installation"
msgstr "Composer 설치"

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:8
msgid ""
"Composer can be used in two ways to install CodeIgniter4 on your system."
msgstr "Composer를 사용하여 시스템에 CodeIgniter4를 설치하는 방법은 두 가지가 있습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:10
msgid "CodeIgniter4 requires Composer 2.0.14 or later."
msgstr "CodeIgniter4는 Composer 2.0.14 이상이 필요합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:12
msgid ""
"If you are not familiar with Composer, we recommend you read `Basic usage "
"<https://getcomposer.org/doc/01-basic-usage.md>`_ first."
msgstr ""
"Composer에 익숙하지 않다면 `\\ 기본 사용법 <https://getcomposer.org/doc/01-basic-"
"usage.md>`_\\ 을 먼저 읽어보는 것을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:15
msgid ""
"The first technique describes creating a skeleton project (app starter) "
"using CodeIgniter4, that you would then use as the base for a new webapp. "
"The second technique described below lets you add CodeIgniter4 to an "
"existing webapp,"
msgstr ""
"첫 번째 기술은 CodeIgniter4를 사용하여 스켈레톤 프로젝트(App Starter)를 생성하고 이를 새로운 웹 앱의 기반으로 "
"사용하는 방법을 설명합니다. 아래에 설명된 두 번째 기술은 기존 웹 앱에 CodeIgniter4를 추가하는 방법을 설명합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:20
msgid ""
"If you are using a Git repository to store your code, or for collaboration "
"with others, then the **vendor** folder would normally be \"git ignored\". "
"In such a case, you will need to do a ``composer install`` (or ``composer "
"update`` if you want to update all Composer dependencies) when you clone the"
" repository to a new system."
msgstr ""
"코드를 저장하거나 다른 사람과 협업하기 위해 Git 저장소를 사용하는 경우, **vendor** 폴더는 일반적으로 \"git "
"ignored\" 상태여야 합니다. 이러한 경우 저장소를 새로운 시스템에 복제할 때 ``composer install``\\ (또는 모든"
" Composer 의존성을 업데이트하려면 ``composer update``)을 실행해야 합니다."

