"Composer."
msgstr ""
"\"수동 설치\"에서 설명된 동일한 `CodeIgniter 4 프레임워크 "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/framework>`_ 저장소를 Composer를 사용하여 기존 프로젝트에 "
"추가할 수도 있습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:230
msgid ""
"Develop your app inside the ``app`` folder, and the ``public`` folder will "
"be your document root."
msgstr "``app`` 폴더 안에서 앱을 개발하고, ``public`` 폴더가 문서 루트가 됩니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:251
msgid "Setting Up"
msgstr "설정"

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:253
msgid ""
"Copy the **app**, **public**, **tests** and **writable** folders from "
"**vendor/codeigniter4/framework** to your project root"
msgstr ""
"**vendor/codeigniter4/framework**\\ 에서 **app**, **public**, **tests**, "
"**writable** 폴더를 프로젝트 루트에 복사하세요."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:254
msgid ""
"Copy the **env**, **phpunit.dist.xml** and **spark** files, from "
"**vendor/codeigniter4/framework** to your project root"
msgstr ""
"**vendor/codeigniter4/framework**\\ 에서 **env**, **phpunit.dist.xml**, "
"**spark** 파일을 프로젝트 루트에 복사하세요."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:255
msgid ""
"You will have to adjust the ``$systemDirectory`` property in "
"**app/Config/Paths.php** to refer to the vendor one, e.g., ``__DIR__ . "
"'/../../vendor/codeigniter4/framework/system'``."
msgstr ""
"**app/Config/Paths.php**\\ 의 ``$systemDirectory`` 속성을 vendor 경로를 참조하도록 조정해야 "
"합니다. 예: ``__DIR__ . '/../../vendor/codeigniter4/framework/system'``."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:260
msgid ""
"A few initial configurations are required. See :ref:`initial-configuration` "
"for the details."
msgstr "몇 가지 초기 설정이 필요합니다. 자세한 내용은 :ref:`initial-configuration`\\ 를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:297
msgid "Relatively simple installation; easy to update."
msgstr "비교적 간단한 설치, 쉬운 업데이트."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:302
msgid ""
"You still need to check for file changes in the **project space** (root, "
"app, public, writable) after updating."
msgstr "업데이트 후 **\\ 프로젝트 공간**\\ (루트, app, public, writable)의 파일 변경 사항을 확인해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:318
#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:67
msgid "Translations Installation"
msgstr "번역 설치"

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:320
#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:69
msgid ""
"If you want to take advantage of the system message translations, they can "
"be added to your project in a similar fashion."
msgstr "시스템 메시지 번역을 활용하려면 비슷한 방법으로 프로젝트에 추가할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:323
msgid "From the command line inside your project root:"
msgstr "프로젝트 루트의 명령줄에서:"

#: ../../source/installation/installing_composer.rst:329
msgid ""
"Copy the **vendor/codeigniter4/translations/Language** folder contents in it"
" to your **app/Language** folder. These will be updated along with the "
"framework whenever you do a ``composer update``."
msgstr ""
"**vendor/codeigniter4/translations/Language** 폴더의 내용을 **app/Language** 폴더에 "
"복사하세요. 이 파일들은 ``composer update``\\ 를 실행할 때마다 프레임워크와 함께 업데이트됩니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:2
msgid "Manual Installation"
msgstr "수동 설치"

#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:8
msgid ""
"The `CodeIgniter 4 framework <https://github.com/codeigniter4/framework>`_ "
"repository holds the released versions of the framework. It is intended for "
"developers who do not wish to use Composer."
msgstr ""
"`CodeIgniter 4 프레임워크 <https://github.com/codeigniter4/framework>`_ 저장소에는 "
"프레임워크의 출시 버전이 포함되어 있습니다. Composer를 사용하지 않으려는 개발자를 위한 방법입니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:12
msgid ""
"Develop your app inside the **app** folder, and the **public** folder will "
"be your public-facing document root. Do not change anything inside the "
"**system** folder!"
msgstr ""
"**app** 폴더 안에서 앱을 개발하고, **public** 폴더가 외부에 공개되는 문서 루트가 됩니다. **system** 폴더 안의"
" 내용은 절대 변경하지 마세요!"

#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:16
msgid ""
"This is the installation technique closest to that described for "
"`CodeIgniter 3 "
"<https://codeigniter.com/userguide3/installation/index.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"이 설치 방법은 `CodeIgniter 3 "
"<https://codeigniter.com/userguide3/installation/index.html>`_\\ 에 설명된 방법과 "
"가장 유사합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:22
msgid ""
"Download the `latest version "
"<https://github.com/CodeIgniter4/framework/releases/latest>`_, and extract "
"it to become your project root."
msgstr ""
"`\\ 최신 버전 <https://github.com/CodeIgniter4/framework/releases/latest>`_\\ 을 "
"다운로드하고 프로젝트 루트가 될 위치에 압축을 해제하세요."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:35
msgid ""
"After installation, a few initial configurations are required. See "
":ref:`initial-configuration` for the detail."
msgstr "설치 후 몇 가지 초기 설정이 필요합니다. 자세한 내용은 :ref:`initial-configuration`\\ 를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:43
msgid ""
"Download a new copy of the framework, and then replace the **system** "
"folder."
msgstr "프레임워크의 새 사본을 다운로드하고 **system** 폴더를 교체하세요."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:51
msgid "Download and run."
msgstr "다운로드하고 실행."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:56
msgid ""
"You need to check for file changes in the **project space** (root, app, "
"public, tests, writable) and merge them by yourself."
msgstr ""
"**\\ 프로젝트 공간**\\ (루트, app, public, tests, writable)의 파일 변경 사항을 직접 확인하고 병합해야 "
"합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:64
msgid "app, public, tests, writable, system"
msgstr "app, public, tests, writable, system"

#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:72
msgid ""
"Download the `latest version of them "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/translations/releases/latest>`_. Extract "
"the downloaded zip, and copy the **Language** folder contents in it to your "
"**app/Languages** folder."
msgstr ""
"`\\ 최신 버전 <https://github.com/codeigniter4/translations/releases/latest>`_\\"
" 을 다운로드하세요. 다운로드한 zip 파일을 압축 해제하고 그 안의 **Language** 폴더 내용을 **app/Languages**"
" 폴더에 복사하세요."

#: ../../source/installation/installing_manual.rst:76
msgid ""
"This would need to be repeated to incorporate any updates to the "
"translations."
msgstr "번역 업데이트를 반영하려면 이 과정을 반복해야 합니다."

