#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_430.rst:114
msgid ""
"During transactions, exceptions are not thrown by default even if "
"``DBDebug`` is true. If you want exceptions to be thrown, you need to call "
"``transException(true)``. See :ref:`transactions-throwing-exceptions`."
msgstr ""
"트랜잭션 중에는 ``DBDebug``\\ 가 true라도 기본적으로 예외가 발생하지 않습니다. 예외가 발생하도록 하려면 "
"``transException(true)``\\ 를 호출해야 합니다. :ref:`transactions-throwing-"
"exceptions`\\ 를 참조하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_430.rst:117
