#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_430.rst:336
#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_430.rst:390
msgid "app/Config/Honeypot.php"
msgstr "app/Config/Honeypot.php"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_430.rst:337
msgid ""
"The new property ``$containerId`` is added to set id attribute value for the"
" container tag when CSP is enabled."
msgstr ""
"CSP가 활성화될 때 컨테이너 태그의 id 속성 값을 설정하기 위한 새 속성 ``$containerId``\\ 가 추가되었습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_430.rst:339
msgid ""
"The ``input`` tag in the property ``$template`` value has been changed to "
"HTML5 compatible."
msgstr "``$template`` 속성 값의 ``input`` 태그가 HTML5 호환으로 변경되었습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_430.rst:341
msgid ""
"The property ``$threshold`` has been changed to ``9`` in other than "
"``production`` environment."
msgstr "``production`` 환경 이외에서 ``$threshold`` 속성이 ``9``\\ 로 변경되었습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_430.rst:343
#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_430.rst:396
#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_437.rst:86
#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_441.rst:40
