msgstr "자세한 내용은 :ref:`\\ 변경 로그 <v470-property-signature-changes>`\\ 를 참조하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_470.rst:106
msgid ""
"Some deprecated items have been removed. If your app still uses or extends "
