"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/general/controllers.html>`_"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_controllers.rst:12
msgid ""
":doc:`Controller Documentation CodeIgniter 4.x </incoming/controllers>`"
msgstr ":doc:`컨트롤러 문서 CodeIgniter 4.x </incoming/controllers>`"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_controllers.rst:17
msgid ""
"Since namespaces have been added to CodeIgniter 4, the controllers must be "
"changed to support namespaces."
msgstr "CodeIgniter 4에 네임스페이스가 추가되었으므로, 컨트롤러를 네임스페이스를 지원하도록 변경해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_controllers.rst:18
msgid ""
"The constructor of CI4 Controller does not automatically load core classes "
"into the properties."
msgstr "CI4 컨트롤러의 생성자는 코어 클래스를 속성에 자동으로 로드하지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_controllers.rst:19
msgid ""
"CI4's Controller has a special constructor :ref:`initController() "
"<controller-constructor>`."
msgstr ""
"CI4의 컨트롤러는 특별한 생성자 :ref:`initController() <controller-constructor>`\\ 를 가지고 "
"있습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_controllers.rst:20
msgid ""
"CI4 provides :doc:`Request </incoming/incomingrequest>` and :doc:`Responses "
"</outgoing/response>` objects for you to work with - more powerful than the "
"CI3-way."
msgstr ""
"CI4는 CI3 방식보다 더 강력한 :doc:`Request </incoming/incomingrequest>` 및 "
":doc:`Responses </outgoing/response>` 객체를 제공합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_controllers.rst:22
msgid ""
"If you want a base controller (``MY_Controller`` in CI3), use "
"**app/Controllers/BaseController.php**."
msgstr ""
"기본 컨트롤러(CI3의 ``MY_Controller``)가 필요하면 "
"**app/Controllers/BaseController.php**\\ 를 사용하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_controllers.rst:23
msgid ""
"Calling ``echo`` within Controllers, as in CI3, is still supported, but it "
"is recommended that a string or Response object be returned from "
"Controllers."
msgstr ""
"CI3처럼 컨트롤러 내에서 ``echo``\\ 를 호출하는 것은 여전히 지원되지만, 컨트롤러에서 문자열 또는 Response 객체를 "
"반환하는 것이 권장됩니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_controllers.rst:29
msgid "First, move all controller files to the folder **app/Controllers**."
msgstr "먼저 모든 컨트롤러 파일을 **app/Controllers** 폴더로 이동하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_controllers.rst:30
msgid ""
"Add this line just after the opening php tag: ``namespace "
"App\\Controllers;``"
msgstr "PHP 여는 태그 바로 뒤에 다음 줄을 추가하십시오: ``namespace App\\Controllers;``"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_controllers.rst:31
msgid "Replace ``extends CI_Controller`` with ``extends BaseController``."
msgstr "``extends CI_Controller``\\ 를 ``extends BaseController``\\ 로 교체하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_controllers.rst:32
#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_migrations.rst:31
#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_views.rst:31
msgid ""
"Remove the line ``defined('BASEPATH') OR exit('No direct script access "
"allowed');`` if it exists."
msgstr ""
"``defined('BASEPATH') OR exit('No direct script access allowed');`` 줄이 있으면 "
"제거하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_controllers.rst:34
msgid ""
"If you use sub-directories in your controller structure, you have to change "
"the namespace according to that."
msgstr "컨트롤러 구조에 하위 디렉토리를 사용하는 경우, 이에 맞게 네임스페이스를 변경해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_controllers.rst:38
msgid ""
"For example, you have a version 3 controller located in "
"**application/controllers/users/auth/Register.php**, the namespace has to be"
" ``namespace App\\Controllers\\Users\\Auth;`` and the controller path in the"
" version 4 should look like this: "
"**app/Controllers/Users/Auth/Register.php**. Make sure to have the first "
"letters of the sub-directories as capitalized."
msgstr ""
"예를 들어, **application/controllers/users/auth/Register.php**\\ 에 위치한 버전 3 "
"컨트롤러가 있다면, 네임스페이스는 ``namespace App\\Controllers\\Users\\Auth;``\\ 여야 하고 버전 "
"4에서 컨트롤러 경로는 **app/Controllers/Users/Auth/Register.php**\\ 와 같아야 합니다. 하위 "
"디렉토리의 첫 글자는 반드시 대문자로 작성하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_controllers.rst:40
msgid ""
"After that you have to insert a ``use`` statement below the namespace "
"definition in order to extend the ``BaseController``: ``use "
"App\\Controllers\\BaseController;``"
msgstr ""
"그 다음 ``BaseController``\\ 를 확장하기 위해 네임스페이스 정의 아래에 ``use`` 구문을 추가해야 합니다: "
"``use App\\Controllers\\BaseController;``"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_controllers.rst:48
#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_validations.rst:84
msgid "Path: **application/controllers**:"
msgstr "경로: **application/controllers**:"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_controllers.rst:55
#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_validations.rst:121
msgid "Path: **app/Controllers**:"
msgstr "경로: **app/Controllers**:"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_database.rst:2
msgid "Upgrade Database"
msgstr "데이터베이스 업그레이드"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_database.rst:11
msgid ""
"`Database Reference Documentation CodeIgniter 3.x "
"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/database/index.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"`데이터베이스 참조 문서 CodeIgniter 3.x "
"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/database/index.html>`_"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_database.rst:12
msgid ""
":doc:`Working with Databases Documentation CodeIgniter 4.x "
"</database/index>`"
msgstr ":doc:`데이터베이스 작업 문서 CodeIgniter 4.x </database/index>`"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_database.rst:16
msgid "The functionality in CI3 is basically the same as in CI4."
msgstr "CI3의 기능은 기본적으로 CI4와 동일합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_database.rst:17
msgid ""
"`Database Caching "
"<https://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/database/caching.html>`_ "
"functionality known from CI3 was removed."
msgstr ""
"CI3에서 알려진 `데이터베이스 캐싱 "
"<https://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/database/caching.html>`_ 기능이 "
"제거되었습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_database.rst:18
msgid ""
"The method names have changed to camelCase and the :doc:`Query Builder "
"<../database/query_builder>` now needs to be initialized before you can run "
"queries on it."
msgstr ""
"메서드 이름이 camelCase로 변경되었으며, :doc:`쿼리 빌더 <../database/query_builder>`\\ 는 쿼리를 "
"실행하기 전에 초기화해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_database.rst:23
msgid ""
"Add your database credentials to **app/Config/Database.php**. The options "
"are pretty much the same as in CI3 only some names have changed slightly."
msgstr ""
"**app/Config/Database.php**\\ 에 데이터베이스 자격 증명을 추가하십시오. 옵션은 CI3과 거의 동일하며 일부 "
"이름만 약간 변경되었습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_database.rst:24
msgid ""
"Everywhere you have used the database you have to replace "
"``$this->load->database();`` with ``$db = db_connect();``."
msgstr ""
"데이터베이스를 사용한 모든 곳에서 ``$this->load->database();``\\ 를 ``$db = "
"db_connect();``\\ 으로 교체해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_database.rst:25
msgid ""
"If you use multiple databases use the following code to load additional "
"databases ``$db = db_connect('group_name');``."
msgstr ""
"여러 데이터베이스를 사용하는 경우 다음 코드를 사용하여 추가 데이터베이스를 로드하십시오: ``$db = "
"db_connect('group_name');``"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_database.rst:26
msgid ""
"Now you have to change all database queries. The most important change here "
"is to replace ``$this->db`` with just ``$db`` and adjust the method name and"
" ``$db``. Here are some examples:"
msgstr ""
"이제 모든 데이터베이스 쿼리를 변경해야 합니다. 가장 중요한 변경은 ``$this->db``\\ 를 ``$db``\\ 로 교체하고 메서드"
" 이름과 ``$db``\\ 를 조정하는 것입니다. 다음은 몇 가지 예입니다:"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_database.rst:28
msgid ""
"``$this->db->query('YOUR QUERY HERE');`` to ``$db->query('YOUR QUERY "
"HERE');``"
msgstr ""
"``$this->db->query('YOUR QUERY HERE');``\\ 를 ``$db->query('YOUR QUERY "
"HERE');``\\ 로"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_database.rst:29
msgid ""
"``$this->db->simple_query('YOUR QUERY')`` to ``$db->simpleQuery('YOUR "
"QUERY')``"
msgstr ""
"``$this->db->simple_query('YOUR QUERY')``\\ 를 ``$db->simpleQuery('YOUR "
"QUERY')``\\ 로"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_database.rst:30
msgid "``$this->db->escape(\"something\")`` to ``$db->escape(\"something\");``"
msgstr "``$this->db->escape(\"something\")``\\ 를 ``$db->escape(\"something\");``\\ 로"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_database.rst:31
msgid "``$this->db->affected_rows();`` to ``$db->affectedRows();``"
msgstr "``$this->db->affected_rows();``\\ 를 ``$db->affectedRows();``\\ 로"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_database.rst:32
msgid "``$query->result();`` to ``$query->getResult();``"
msgstr "``$query->result();``\\ 를 ``$query->getResult();``\\ 로"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_database.rst:33
msgid "``$query->result_array();`` to ``$query->getResultArray();``"
msgstr "``$query->result_array();``\\ 를 ``$query->getResultArray();``\\ 로"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_database.rst:34
msgid ""
"``echo $this->db->count_all('my_table');`` to ``echo "
"$db->table('my_table')->countAll();``"
msgstr ""
"``echo $this->db->count_all('my_table');``\\ 를 ``echo "
"$db->table('my_table')->countAll();``\\ 로"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_database.rst:36
msgid ""
"To use the new Query Builder Class you have to initialize the builder "
"``$builder = $db->table('mytable');`` after that you can run the queries on "
"the ``$builder``. Here are some examples:"
msgstr ""
"새로운 쿼리 빌더 클래스를 사용하려면 ``$builder = $db->table('mytable');``\\ 으로 빌더를 초기화한 다음 "
"``$builder``\\ 에서 쿼리를 실행할 수 있습니다. 다음은 몇 가지 예입니다:"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_database.rst:38
msgid "``$this->db->get()`` to ``$builder->get();``"
msgstr "``$this->db->get()``\\ 를 ``$builder->get();``\\ 로"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_database.rst:39
msgid ""
"``$this->db->get_where('mytable', array('id' => $id), $limit, $offset);`` to"
" ``$builder->getWhere(['id' => $id], $limit, $offset);``"
msgstr ""
"``$this->db->get_where('mytable', array('id' => $id), $limit, $offset);``\\ "
"를 ``$builder->getWhere(['id' => $id], $limit, $offset);``\\ 로"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_database.rst:40
msgid ""
"``$this->db->select('title, content, date');`` to ``$builder->select('title,"
" content, date');``"
msgstr ""
"``$this->db->select('title, content, date');``\\ 를 "
"``$builder->select('title, content, date');``\\ 로"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_database.rst:41
msgid "``$this->db->select_max('age');`` to ``$builder->selectMax('age');``"
msgstr "``$this->db->select_max('age');``\\ 를 ``$builder->selectMax('age');``\\ 로"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_database.rst:42
msgid ""
"``$this->db->join('comments', 'comments.id = blogs.id');`` to "
"``$builder->join('comments', 'comments.id = blogs.id');``"
msgstr ""
"``$this->db->join('comments', 'comments.id = blogs.id');``\\ 를 "
"``$builder->join('comments', 'comments.id = blogs.id');``\\ 로"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_database.rst:43
msgid ""
"``$this->db->having('user_id',  45);`` to ``$builder->having('user_id',  "
"45);``"
msgstr ""
"``$this->db->having('user_id',  45);``\\ 를 ``$builder->having('user_id',  "
"45);``\\ 로"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_database.rst:44
msgid ""
"CI4 does not provide `Database Caching "
"<https://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/database/caching.html>`_ layer known"
" from CI3, so if you need to cache the result, use "
":doc:`../libraries/caching` instead."
msgstr ""
"CI4는 CI3에서 알려진 `데이터베이스 캐싱 "
"<https://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/database/caching.html>`_ 계층을 제공하지 "
"않으므로, 결과를 캐시해야 하는 경우 :doc:`../libraries/caching`\\ 을 대신 사용하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_database.rst:46
msgid ""
"If you use ``limit(0)`` in Query Builder, CI4 returns all records in stead "
"of no records due to a bug. But since v4.5.0, you can change the incorrect "
"behavior with a setting. So change the setting. See :ref:`v450-query-"
"builder-limit-0-behavior` for details."
msgstr ""
"쿼리 빌더에서 ``limit(0)``\\ 을 사용하면 CI4는 버그로 인해 레코드가 없는 대신 모든 레코드를 반환합니다. 그러나 "
"v4.5.0부터 설정으로 이 잘못된 동작을 변경할 수 있습니다. 자세한 내용은 :ref:`v450-query-builder-"
"limit-0-behavior`\\ 를 참조하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_emails.rst:2
msgid "Upgrade Emails"
msgstr "이메일 업그레이드"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_emails.rst:11
msgid ""
"`Email Documentation CodeIgniter 3.x "
"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/email.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"`이메일 문서 CodeIgniter 3.x "
"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/email.html>`_"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_emails.rst:12
msgid ":doc:`Email Documentation CodeIgniter 4.x </libraries/email>`"
msgstr ":doc:`이메일 문서 CodeIgniter 4.x </libraries/email>`"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_emails.rst:16
#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_html_tables.rst:16
#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_sessions.rst:16
msgid ""
"Only small things like the method names and the loading of the library have "
"changed."
msgstr "메서드 이름과 라이브러리 로드 방법과 같은 소소한 부분만 변경되었습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_emails.rst:17
msgid ""
"The behavior when using the SMTP protocol has been slightly changed. You may"
" not be able to communicate with your SMTP server properly if you use the "
"CI3 settings. See :ref:`email-ssl-tls-for-smtp` and :ref:`email-"
"preferences`."
msgstr ""
"SMTP 프로토콜 사용 시 동작이 약간 변경되었습니다. CI3 설정을 사용하면 SMTP 서버와 제대로 통신하지 못할 수 있습니다. "
":ref:`email-ssl-tls-for-smtp` 및 :ref:`email-preferences`\\ 를 참조하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_emails.rst:21
msgid ""
"Within your class change the ``$this->load->library('email');`` to ``$email "
"= service('email');``."
msgstr ""
"클래스 내에서 ``$this->load->library('email');``\\ 을 ``$email = "
"service('email');``\\ 로 변경하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_emails.rst:22
msgid ""
"From that on you have to replace every line starting with ``$this->email`` "
"to ``$email``."
msgstr "그 이후 ``$this->email``\\ 로 시작하는 모든 줄을 ``$email``\\ 로 교체해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_emails.rst:23
msgid ""
"The methods in the Email class are named slightly different. All methods, "
"except for ``send()``, ``attach()``, ``printDebugger()`` and ``clear()`` "
"have a ``set`` as prefix followed by the previous method name. ``bcc()`` is "
"now ``setBcc()`` and so on."
msgstr ""
"Email 클래스의 메서드 이름이 약간 다릅니다. ``send()``, ``attach()``, ``printDebugger()``, "
"``clear()``\\ 를 제외한 모든 메서드는 이전 메서드 이름 앞에 ``set`` 접두사가 붙습니다. ``bcc()``\\ 는 이제"
" ``setBcc()``\\ 이 되는 식입니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_emails.rst:24
msgid ""
"The config attributes in **app/Config/Email.php** have changed. You should "
"have a look at the :ref:`setting-email-preferences` to have a list of the "
"new attributes."
msgstr ""
"**app/Config/Email.php**\\ 의 설정 속성이 변경되었습니다. 새 속성 목록은 :ref:`setting-email-"
"preferences`\\ 를 참조하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_encryption.rst:2
msgid "Upgrade Encryption"
msgstr "암호화 업그레이드"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_encryption.rst:11
msgid ""
"`Encryption Library Documentation CodeIgniter 3.x "
"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/encryption.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"`암호화 라이브러리 문서 CodeIgniter 3.x "
"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/encryption.html>`_"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_encryption.rst:12
msgid ""
":doc:`Encryption Service Documentation CodeIgniter 4.x "
"</libraries/encryption>`"
msgstr ":doc:`암호화 서비스 문서 CodeIgniter 4.x </libraries/encryption>`"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_encryption.rst:17
msgid ""
"The support for ``MCrypt`` has been dropped, as that has been deprecated as "
"of PHP 7.2."
msgstr "PHP 7.2부터 deprecated된 ``MCrypt``\\ 에 대한 지원이 중단되었습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_encryption.rst:22
msgid ""
"Within your configs the ``$config['encryption_key'] = 'abc123';`` moved from"
" **application/config/config.php** to ``public $key = 'abc123';`` in "
"**app/Config/Encryption.php**."
msgstr ""
"설정에서 ``$config['encryption_key'] = 'abc123';``\\ 이 "
"**application/config/config.php**\\ 에서 **app/Config/Encryption.php**\\ 의 "
"``public $key = 'abc123';``\\ 으로 이동되었습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_encryption.rst:23
msgid ""
"If you need to decrypt data encrypted with CI3's Encryption, configure "
"settings to maintain compatibility. See :ref:`encryption-compatible-with-"
"ci3`."
msgstr ""
"CI3의 암호화로 암호화된 데이터를 복호화해야 하는 경우, 호환성을 유지하도록 설정을 구성하십시오. :ref:`encryption-"
"compatible-with-ci3`\\ 를 참조하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_encryption.rst:24
msgid ""
"Wherever you have used the encryption library you have to replace "
"``$this->load->library('encryption');`` with ``$encrypter = "
"service('encrypter');`` and change the methods for encryption and decrypting"
" like in the following code example."
msgstr ""
"암호화 라이브러리를 사용한 모든 곳에서 ``$this->load->library('encryption');``\\ 을 "
"``$encrypter = service('encrypter');``\\ 로 교체하고, 다음 코드 예제와 같이 암호화 및 복호화 메서드를"
" 변경해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_file_upload.rst:2
msgid "Upgrade Working with Uploaded Files"
msgstr "업로드 파일 작업 업그레이드"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_file_upload.rst:10
msgid ""
"`File Uploading Class Documentation CodeIgniter 3.x "
"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/file_uploading.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"`파일 업로드 클래스 문서 CodeIgniter 3.x "
"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/file_uploading.html>`_"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_file_upload.rst:11
msgid ""
":doc:`Working with Uploaded Files Documentation CodeIgniter 4.x "
"</libraries/uploaded_files>`"
msgstr ":doc:`업로드 파일 작업 문서 CodeIgniter 4.x </libraries/uploaded_files>`"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_file_upload.rst:15
msgid ""
"The functionality of the file upload has changed a lot. You can now check if"
" the file got uploaded without errors and moving / storing files is simpler."
msgstr ""
"파일 업로드 기능이 많이 변경되었습니다. 이제 파일이 오류 없이 업로드되었는지 확인할 수 있으며 파일 이동/저장이 더 간단해졌습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_file_upload.rst:19
msgid ""
"In CI4 you access uploaded files with ``$file = "
"$this->request->getFile('userfile')``. From there you can validate if the "
"file got uploaded successfully with ``$file->isValid()``. To store the file "
"you could use ``$path = "
"$this->request->getFile('userfile')->store('head_img/', 'user_name.jpg');``."
" This will store the file in **writable/uploads/head_img/user_name.jpg**."
msgstr ""
"CI4에서는 ``$file = $this->request->getFile('userfile')``\\ 으로 업로드된 파일에 접근합니다. "
"그런 다음 ``$file->isValid()``\\ 로 파일이 성공적으로 업로드되었는지 유효성을 검사할 수 있습니다. 파일을 저장하려면 "
"``$path = $this->request->getFile('userfile')->store('head_img/', "
"'user_name.jpg');``\\ 을 사용할 수 있습니다. 이렇게 하면 파일이 "
"**writable/uploads/head_img/user_name.jpg**\\ 에 저장됩니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_file_upload.rst:22
msgid "You have to change your file uploading code to match the new methods."
msgstr "새 메서드에 맞게 파일 업로드 코드를 변경해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_html_tables.rst:2
msgid "Upgrade HTML Tables"
msgstr "HTML 테이블 업그레이드"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_html_tables.rst:11
msgid ""
"`HTML Table Documentation CodeIgniter 3.x "
"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/table.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"`HTML 테이블 문서 CodeIgniter 3.x "
"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/table.html>`_"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_html_tables.rst:12
msgid ":doc:`HTML Table Documentation CodeIgniter 4.x </outgoing/table>`"
msgstr ":doc:`HTML 테이블 문서 CodeIgniter 4.x </outgoing/table>`"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_html_tables.rst:20
msgid ""
"Within your class change the ``$this->load->library('table');`` to ``$table "
"= new \\CodeIgniter\\View\\Table();``."
msgstr ""
"클래스 내에서 ``$this->load->library('table');``\\ 을 ``$table = new "
"\\CodeIgniter\\View\\Table();``\\ 로 변경하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_html_tables.rst:21
msgid ""
"From that on you have to replace every line starting with ``$this->table`` "
"to ``$table``. For example: ``echo $this->table->generate($query);`` will "
"become ``echo $table->generate($query);``"
msgstr ""
"그 이후 ``$this->table``\\ 로 시작하는 모든 줄을 ``$table``\\ 로 교체해야 합니다. 예를 들어: ``echo "
"$this->table->generate($query);``\\ 은 ``echo $table->generate($query);``\\ 가"
" 됩니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_html_tables.rst:22
msgid ""
"The methods in the HTML Table class could be named slightly different. The "
"most important change in the naming is the switch from underscored method "
"names to camelCase. The method ``set_heading()`` from version 3 is now named"
" ``setHeading()`` and so on."
msgstr ""
"HTML 테이블 클래스의 메서드 이름이 약간 다를 수 있습니다. 가장 중요한 이름 변경은 밑줄 메서드 이름에서 camelCase로의 "
"전환입니다. 버전 3의 ``set_heading()`` 메서드는 이제 ``setHeading()``\\ 이 되는 식입니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_images.rst:2
msgid "Upgrade Image Manipulation Class"
msgstr "이미지 조작 클래스 업그레이드"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_images.rst:11
msgid ""
"`Image Manipulation Class Documentation CodeIgniter 3.x "
"<https://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/image_lib.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"`이미지 조작 클래스 문서 CodeIgniter 3.x "
"<https://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/image_lib.html>`_"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_images.rst:12
msgid ""
":doc:`Image Manipulation Class Documentation CodeIgniter 4.x "
"<../libraries/images>`"
msgstr ":doc:`이미지 조작 클래스 문서 CodeIgniter 4.x <../libraries/images>`"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_images.rst:16
msgid ""
"The preferences passed to the constructor or ``initialize()`` method in CI3 "
"have been changed to be specified in the new methods in CI4."
msgstr ""
"CI3에서 생성자 또는 ``initialize()`` 메서드에 전달되던 설정이 CI4의 새 메서드에서 지정하는 방식으로 변경되었습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_images.rst:18
msgid "Some preferences like ``create_thumb`` are removed."
msgstr "``create_thumb``\\ 과 같은 일부 설정이 제거되었습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_images.rst:19
msgid ""
"In CI4, the ``save()`` method must be called to save the manipulated image."
msgstr "CI4에서는 조작된 이미지를 저장하기 위해 ``save()`` 메서드를 호출해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_images.rst:20
msgid ""
"The ``display_errors()`` has been removed, and an exception will be thrown "
"if an error occurs."
msgstr "``display_errors()``\\ 가 제거되었으며, 오류 발생 시 예외가 던져집니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_images.rst:25
msgid ""
"Within your class change the ``$this->load->library('image_lib');`` to "
"``$image = \\Config\\Services::image();``."
msgstr ""
"클래스 내에서 ``$this->load->library('image_lib');``\\ 을 ``$image = "
"\\Config\\Services::image();``\\ 로 변경하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_images.rst:27
msgid ""
"Change the preferences passed to the constructor or ``initialize()`` method "
"to be specified in the corresponding methods."
msgstr "생성자 또는 ``initialize()`` 메서드에 전달되던 설정을 해당 메서드에서 지정하는 방식으로 변경하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_images.rst:29
msgid "Call the ``save()`` method to save the file."
msgstr "파일을 저장하려면 ``save()`` 메서드를 호출하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_localization.rst:2
msgid "Upgrade Localization"
msgstr "로컬라이제이션 업그레이드"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_localization.rst:11
msgid ""
"`Language Documentation CodeIgniter 3.x "
"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/language.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"`언어 문서 CodeIgniter 3.x "
"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/language.html>`_"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_localization.rst:12
msgid ""
":doc:`Localization Documentation CodeIgniter 4.x </outgoing/localization>`"
msgstr ":doc:`로컬라이제이션 문서 CodeIgniter 4.x </outgoing/localization>`"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_localization.rst:16
msgid "In CI4 the language files return the language lines as array."
msgstr "CI4에서 언어 파일은 언어 문자열을 배열로 반환합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_localization.rst:20
msgid "Specify the default language in **Config/App.php**:"
msgstr "**Config/App.php**\\ 에서 기본 언어를 지정하십시오:"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_localization.rst:24
msgid "Now move your language files to **app/Language/<locale>**."
msgstr "이제 언어 파일을 **app/Language/<locale>**\\ 로 이동하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_localization.rst:25
msgid ""
"After that you have to change the syntax within the language files. Below in"
" the Code Example you will see how the language array within the file should"
" look like."
msgstr ""
"그 다음 언어 파일 내의 구문을 변경해야 합니다. 아래 코드 예제에서 파일 내의 언어 배열이 어떻게 표시되어야 하는지 확인할 수 "
"있습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_localization.rst:26
msgid ""
"Remove from every file the language loader ``$this->lang->load($file, "
"$lang);``."
msgstr "모든 파일에서 언어 로더 ``$this->lang->load($file, $lang);``\\ 을 제거하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_localization.rst:27
msgid ""
"Replace the method to load the language line "
"``$this->lang->line('error_email_missing')`` with ``echo "
"lang('Errors.errorEmailMissing');``."
msgstr ""
"언어 문자열을 로드하는 메서드 ``$this->lang->line('error_email_missing')``\\ 을 ``echo "
"lang('Errors.errorEmailMissing');``\\ 으로 교체하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_migrations.rst:2
msgid "Upgrade Migrations"
msgstr "마이그레이션 업그레이드"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_migrations.rst:11
msgid ""
"`Database Migrations Documentation CodeIgniter 3.x "
"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/migration.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"`데이터베이스 마이그레이션 문서 CodeIgniter 3.x "
"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/migration.html>`_"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_migrations.rst:12
msgid ""
":doc:`Database Migrations Documentation CodeIgniter 4.x </dbmgmt/migration>`"
msgstr ":doc:`데이터베이스 마이그레이션 문서 CodeIgniter 4.x </dbmgmt/migration>`"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_migrations.rst:17
msgid ""
"First of all, the sequential naming (``001_create_users``, "
"``002_create_posts``) of migrations is not longer supported. Version 4 of "
"CodeIgniter only supports the timestamp scheme "
"(``20121031100537_create_users``, ``20121031500638_create_posts``) . If you "
"have used sequential naming you have to rename each migration file."
msgstr ""
"우선, 마이그레이션의 순차적 명명(``001_create_users``, ``002_create_posts``)이 더 이상 지원되지 "
"않습니다. CodeIgniter 버전 4는 타임스탬프 방식 (``20121031100537_create_users``, "
"``20121031500638_create_posts``)만 지원합니다. 순차적 명명을 사용한 경우 각 마이그레이션 파일의 이름을 "
"변경해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_migrations.rst:18
msgid ""
"The migration table definition was changed. If you upgrade from CI3 to CI4 "
"and use the same database, You need to upgrade the migration table "
"definition and its data."
msgstr ""
"마이그레이션 테이블 정의가 변경되었습니다. CI3에서 CI4로 업그레이드하고 동일한 데이터베이스를 사용하는 경우, 마이그레이션 테이블 "
"정의와 데이터를 업그레이드해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_migrations.rst:20
msgid ""
"The migration procedure has been also changed. You can now migrate the "
"database with a simple CLI command:"
msgstr "마이그레이션 절차도 변경되었습니다. 이제 간단한 CLI 명령어로 데이터베이스를 마이그레이션할 수 있습니다:"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_migrations.rst:29
msgid ""
"If your v3 project uses sequential migration names you have to change those "
"to timestamp names."
msgstr "v3 프로젝트에서 순차적 마이그레이션 이름을 사용하는 경우 타임스탬프 이름으로 변경해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_migrations.rst:30
msgid ""
"You have to move all migration files to the new folder "
"**app/Database/Migrations**."
msgstr "모든 마이그레이션 파일을 새 폴더 **app/Database/Migrations**\\ 로 이동해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_migrations.rst:32
msgid ""
"Add this line just after the opening php tag: ``namespace "
"App\\Database\\Migrations;``."
msgstr "PHP 여는 태그 바로 뒤에 다음 줄을 추가하십시오: ``namespace App\\Database\\Migrations;``"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_migrations.rst:33
msgid ""
"Below the ``namespace App\\Database\\Migrations;`` line add this line: ``use"
" CodeIgniter\\Database\\Migration;``"
msgstr ""
"``namespace App\\Database\\Migrations;`` 줄 아래에 다음 줄을 추가하십시오: ``use "
"CodeIgniter\\Database\\Migration;``"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_migrations.rst:34
msgid "Replace ``extends CI_Migration`` with ``extends Migration``."
msgstr "``extends CI_Migration``\\ 을 ``extends Migration``\\ 으로 교체하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_migrations.rst:35
msgid ""
"The method names within the ``Forge`` class has been changed to use "
"camelCase. For example:"
msgstr "``Forge`` 클래스 내의 메서드 이름이 camelCase를 사용하도록 변경되었습니다. 예를 들어:"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_migrations.rst:37
msgid "``$this->dbforge->add_field`` to ``$this->forge->addField``"
msgstr "``$this->dbforge->add_field``\\ 를 ``$this->forge->addField``\\ 로"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_migrations.rst:38
msgid "``$this->dbforge->add_key`` to ``$this->forge->addKey``"
msgstr "``$this->dbforge->add_key``\\ 를 ``$this->forge->addKey``\\ 로"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_migrations.rst:39
msgid "``$this->dbforge->create_table`` to ``$this->forge->addTable``"
msgstr "``$this->dbforge->create_table``\\ 를 ``$this->forge->addTable``\\ 로"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_migrations.rst:40
msgid "``$this->dbforge->drop_table`` to ``$this->forge->addTable``"
msgstr "``$this->dbforge->drop_table``\\ 를 ``$this->forge->addTable``\\ 로"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_migrations.rst:42
msgid ""
"(optional) You can change the array syntax from ``array(...)`` to ``[...]``"
msgstr "(선택 사항) 배열 구문을 ``array(...)``\\ 에서 ``[...]``\\ 로 변경할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_migrations.rst:43
msgid "Upgrade the migration table, if you use the same database."
msgstr "동일한 데이터베이스를 사용하는 경우 마이그레이션 테이블을 업그레이드하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_migrations.rst:45
msgid ""
"**(development)** Run the CI4 migration in the development environment or so"
" with brand new database, to create the new migration table."
msgstr ""
"**(개발)** 새 마이그레이션 테이블을 생성하기 위해 개발 환경 또는 완전히 새로운 데이터베이스에서 CI4 마이그레이션을 실행하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_migrations.rst:46
msgid "**(development)** Export the migration table."
msgstr "**(개발)** 마이그레이션 테이블을 내보내십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_migrations.rst:47
msgid "**(production)** Drop (or rename) the existing CI3 migration table."
msgstr "**(프로덕션)** 기존 CI3 마이그레이션 테이블을 삭제(또는 이름 변경)하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_migrations.rst:48
msgid "**(production)** Import the new migration table and the data."
msgstr "**(프로덕션)** 새 마이그레이션 테이블과 데이터를 가져오십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_migrations.rst:56
msgid "Path: **application/migrations**:"
msgstr "경로: **application/migrations**:"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_migrations.rst:63
msgid "Path: **app/Database/Migrations**:"
msgstr "경로: **app/Database/Migrations**:"

