#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_pagination.rst:29
msgid ""
"You can use the built-in ``paginate()`` method on every Model. Have a look "
"at the code example below to see how you setup the pagination on a specific "
"model."
msgstr ""
"모든 모델에서 내장 ``paginate()`` 메서드를 사용할 수 있습니다. 아래 코드 예제를 참조하여 특정 모델에서 페이지네이션을 "
"설정하는 방법을 확인하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_responses.rst:2
msgid "Upgrade Output Class"
msgstr "Output 클래스 업그레이드"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_responses.rst:10
msgid ""
"`Output Class Documentation CodeIgniter 3.x "
"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/output.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Output 클래스 문서 CodeIgniter 3.x "
"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/output.html>`_"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_responses.rst:11
msgid ""
":doc:`HTTP Responses Documentation CodeIgniter 4.x </outgoing/response>`"
msgstr ":doc:`HTTP 응답 문서 CodeIgniter 4.x </outgoing/response>`"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_responses.rst:15
msgid "The Output class has been changed to the Response class."
msgstr "Output 클래스가 Response 클래스로 변경되었습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_responses.rst:16
msgid "The methods have been renamed."
msgstr "메서드 이름이 변경되었습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_responses.rst:20
msgid ""
"The methods in the HTTP Response class are named slightly different. The "
"most important change in the naming is the switch from underscored method "
"names to camelCase. The method ``set_content_type()`` from version 3 is now "
"named ``setContentType()`` and so on."
msgstr ""
"HTTP Response 클래스의 메서드 이름이 약간 다릅니다. 가장 중요한 이름 변경은 밑줄 메서드 이름에서 camelCase로의 "
"전환입니다. 버전 3의 ``set_content_type()`` 메서드는 이제 ``setContentType()``\\ 이 되는 "
"식입니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_responses.rst:21
msgid ""
"In the most cases you have to change ``$this->output`` to "
"``$this->response`` followed by the method. You can find all methods in "
":doc:`../outgoing/response`."
msgstr ""
"대부분의 경우 ``$this->output``\\ 을 ``$this->response``\\ 로 변경한 후 메서드를 이어서 써야 합니다."
" 모든 메서드는 :doc:`../outgoing/response`\\ 에서 확인할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_routing.rst:2
msgid "Upgrade Routing"
msgstr "라우팅 업그레이드"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_routing.rst:11
msgid ""
"`URI Routing Documentation CodeIgniter 3.x "
"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/general/routing.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"`URI 라우팅 문서 CodeIgniter 3.x "
"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/general/routing.html>`_"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_routing.rst:12
msgid ":doc:`URI Routing Documentation CodeIgniter 4.x </incoming/routing>`"
msgstr ":doc:`URI 라우팅 문서 CodeIgniter 4.x </incoming/routing>`"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_routing.rst:17
msgid "In CI4 the Auto Routing is disabled by default."
msgstr "CI4에서 자동 라우팅은 기본적으로 비활성화되어 있습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_routing.rst:18
msgid "In CI4 the new more secure :ref:`auto-routing-improved` is introduced."
msgstr "CI4에서 더 안전한 새로운 :ref:`auto-routing-improved`\\ 가 도입되었습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_routing.rst:19
msgid ""
"In CI4 the routing is no longer configured by setting the routes as array."
msgstr "CI4에서 라우팅은 더 이상 라우트를 배열로 설정하는 방식으로 구성되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_routing.rst:20
msgid ""
"The Wildcard ``(:any)`` In CI3 will be the Placeholder ``(:segment)`` in "
"CI4. The ``(:any)`` in CI4 matches multiple segements. See :ref:`URI Routing"
" <routing-placeholder-any>`."
msgstr ""
"CI3의 와일드카드 ``(:any)``\\ 는 CI4에서 플레이스홀더 ``(:segment)``\\ 가 됩니다. CI4의 "
"``(:any)``\\ 는 여러 세그먼트와 일치합니다. :ref:`URI 라우팅 <routing-placeholder-any>`\\ 을 "
"참조하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_routing.rst:25
msgid ""
"If you use the Auto Routing in the same way as CI3, you need to enable "
":ref:`auto-routing-legacy`."
msgstr "CI3과 동일한 방식으로 자동 라우팅을 사용하는 경우 :ref:`auto-routing-legacy`\\ 를 활성화해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_routing.rst:26
msgid ""
"You have to change the syntax of each routing line and append it in "
"**app/Config/Routes.php**. For example:"
msgstr "각 라우팅 줄의 구문을 변경하여 **app/Config/Routes.php**\\ 에 추가해야 합니다. 예를 들어:"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_routing.rst:28
msgid ""
"``$route['journals'] = 'blogs';`` to ``$routes->add('journals', "
"'Blogs::index');``. This would map to the ``index()`` method in the "
"``Blogs`` controller."
msgstr ""
"``$route['journals'] = 'blogs';``\\ 를 ``$routes->add('journals', "
"'Blogs::index');``\\ 로 변경합니다. 이는 ``Blogs`` 컨트롤러의 ``index()`` 메서드로 매핑됩니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_routing.rst:29
msgid ""
"``$route['product/(:any)'] = 'catalog/product_lookup';`` to "
"``$routes->add('product/(:segment)', 'Catalog::productLookup');``. Don't "
"forget to replace ``(:any)`` with ``(:segment)``."
msgstr ""
"``$route['product/(:any)'] = 'catalog/product_lookup';``\\ 를 "
"``$routes->add('product/(:segment)', 'Catalog::productLookup');``\\ 로 변경합니다."
" ``(:any)``\\ 를 ``(:segment)``\\ 으로 교체하는 것을 잊지 마십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_routing.rst:30
msgid ""
"``$route['login/(.+)'] = 'auth/login/$1';`` to ``$routes->add('login/(.+)', "
"'Auth::login/$1');``"
msgstr ""
"``$route['login/(.+)'] = 'auth/login/$1';``\\ 를 ``$routes->add('login/(.+)',"
" 'Auth::login/$1');``\\ 로"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_routing.rst:32
#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_routing.rst:51
msgid ""
"For backward compatibility, ``$routes->add()`` is used here. But we strongly"
" recommend to use :ref:`routing-http-verb-routes` like ``$routes->get()`` "
"instead of ``$routes->add()`` for security."
msgstr ""
"하위 호환성을 위해 여기서는 ``$routes->add()``\\ 를 사용합니다. 그러나 보안을 위해 ``$routes->add()`` "
"대신 ``$routes->get()``\\ 과 같은 :ref:`routing-http-verb-routes`\\ 를 사용하는 것을 강력히"
" 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_routing.rst:41
msgid "Path: **application/config/routes.php**:"
msgstr "경로: **application/config/routes.php**:"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_routing.rst:47
msgid "Path: **app/Config/Routes.php**:"
msgstr "경로: **app/Config/Routes.php**:"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_security.rst:2
msgid "Upgrade Security"
msgstr "보안 업그레이드"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_security.rst:11
msgid ""
"`Security Class Documentation CodeIgniter 3.x "
"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/security.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"`보안 클래스 문서 CodeIgniter 3.x "
"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/security.html>`_"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_security.rst:12
msgid ":doc:`Security Documentation CodeIgniter 4.x </libraries/security>`"
msgstr ":doc:`보안 문서 CodeIgniter 4.x </libraries/security>`"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_security.rst:15
msgid ""
"If you use the :doc:`../helpers/form_helper` and enable the CSRF filter "
"globally, then :php:func:`form_open()` will automatically insert a hidden "
"CSRF field in your forms. So you do not have to upgrade this by yourself."
msgstr ""
":doc:`../helpers/form_helper`\\ 를 사용하고 CSRF 필터를 전역적으로 활성화하면, "
":php:func:`form_open()`\\ 이 폼에 숨겨진 CSRF 필드를 자동으로 삽입합니다. 따라서 직접 업그레이드할 필요가 "
"없습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_security.rst:19
msgid "The method to implement CSRF tokens to HTML forms has been changed."
msgstr "HTML 폼에 CSRF 토큰을 구현하는 방법이 변경되었습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_security.rst:23
msgid ""
"To enable CSRF protection in CI4 you have to enable it in "
"**app/Config/Filters.php**:"
msgstr "CI4에서 CSRF 보호를 활성화하려면 **app/Config/Filters.php**\\ 에서 활성화해야 합니다:"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_security.rst:27
msgid ""
"Within your HTML forms you have to remove the CSRF input field which looks "
"similar to ``<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"<?= $csrf['name'] ?>\" "
"value=\"<?= $csrf['hash'] ?>\" />``."
msgstr ""
"HTML 폼에서 ``<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"<?= $csrf['name'] ?>\" value=\"<?= "
"$csrf['hash'] ?>\" />``\\ 와 유사한 CSRF 입력 필드를 제거해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_security.rst:28
msgid ""
"Now, within your HTML forms you have to add ``<?= csrf_field() ?>`` "
"somewhere in the form body, unless you are using ``form_open()``."
msgstr ""
"이제 ``form_open()``\\ 을 사용하지 않는 경우, HTML 폼의 본문 어딘가에 ``<?= csrf_field() ?>``\\"
" 를 추가해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_sessions.rst:2
msgid "Upgrade Sessions"
msgstr "세션 업그레이드"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_sessions.rst:11
msgid ""
"`Session Library Documentation CodeIgniter 3.x "
"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/sessions.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"`세션 라이브러리 문서 CodeIgniter 3.x "
"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/sessions.html>`_"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_sessions.rst:12
msgid ""
":doc:`Session Library Documentation CodeIgniter 4.x </libraries/sessions>`"
msgstr ":doc:`세션 라이브러리 문서 CodeIgniter 4.x </libraries/sessions>`"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_sessions.rst:17
msgid "The definition of the session table in Database Driver has changed."
msgstr "데이터베이스 드라이버의 세션 테이블 정의가 변경되었습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_sessions.rst:21
msgid ""
"Wherever you use the Session Library replace "
"``$this->load->library('session');`` with ``$session = session();``."
msgstr ""
"세션 라이브러리를 사용한 모든 곳에서 ``$this->load->library('session');``\\ 을 ``$session = "
"session();``\\ 으로 교체하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_sessions.rst:22
msgid ""
"From that on you have to replace every line starting with ``$this->session``"
" with ``$session`` followed by the new method name."
msgstr ""
"그 이후 ``$this->session``\\ 으로 시작하는 모든 줄을 새 메서드 이름이 뒤따르는 ``$session``\\ 으로 "
"교체해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_sessions.rst:24
msgid ""
"To access session data use the syntax ``$session->item`` or "
"``$session->get('item')`` instead of the CI3 syntax "
"``$this->session->name``."
msgstr ""
"세션 데이터에 접근하려면 CI3 구문 ``$this->session->name`` 대신 ``$session->item`` 또는 "
"``$session->get('item')`` 구문을 사용하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_sessions.rst:25
msgid ""
"To set data use ``$session->set($array);`` instead of "
"``$this->session->set_userdata($array);``."
msgstr ""
"데이터를 설정하려면 ``$this->session->set_userdata($array);`` 대신 "
"``$session->set($array);``\\ 를 사용하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_sessions.rst:26
msgid ""
"To remove data use ``unset($_SESSION['some_name']);`` or "
"``$session->remove('some_name');`` instead of "
"``$this->session->unset_userdata('some_name');``."
msgstr ""
"데이터를 제거하려면 ``$this->session->unset_userdata('some_name');`` 대신 "
"``unset($_SESSION['some_name']);`` 또는 ``$session->remove('some_name');``\\ 를"
" 사용하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_sessions.rst:27
msgid ""
"To mark session data as flashdata, which will only be available for the next"
" request, use ``$session->markAsFlashdata('item');`` instead of "
"``$this->session->mark_as_flash('item');```"
msgstr ""
"다음 요청에서만 사용 가능한 플래시데이터로 세션 데이터를 표시하려면 "
"``$this->session->mark_as_flash('item');`` 대신 "
"``$session->markAsFlashdata('item');``\\ 을 사용하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_sessions.rst:28
msgid ""
"If you use Database Driver, you need to recreate the session table. See "
":ref:`sessions-databasehandler-driver`."
msgstr ""
"데이터베이스 드라이버를 사용하는 경우 세션 테이블을 다시 생성해야 합니다. :ref:`sessions-databasehandler-"
"driver`\\ 를 참조하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_validations.rst:2
msgid "Upgrade Validations"
msgstr "유효성 검사 업그레이드"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_validations.rst:9
msgid "Documentations of Library"
msgstr "라이브러리 문서"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_validations.rst:11
msgid ""
"`Form Validation Documentation CodeIgniter 3.x "
"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/form_validation.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"`폼 유효성 검사 문서 CodeIgniter 3.x "
"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/form_validation.html>`_"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_validations.rst:12
msgid ""
":doc:`Validation Documentation CodeIgniter 4.x </libraries/validation>`"
msgstr ":doc:`유효성 검사 문서 CodeIgniter 4.x </libraries/validation>`"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_validations.rst:16
msgid ""
"If you want to change validation error display, you have to set CI4 "
":ref:`validation View templates <validation-customizing-error-display>`."
msgstr ""
"유효성 검사 오류 표시를 변경하려면 CI4 :ref:`유효성 검사 뷰 템플릿 <validation-customizing-error-"
"display>`\\ 을 설정해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_validations.rst:17
msgid ""
"CI4 validation has no `Callbacks "
"<http://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/form_validation.html#callbacks-"
"your-own-validation-methods>`_ in CI3. Use :ref:`Callable Rules <validation-"
"using-callable-rule>` (since v4.5.0) or :ref:`Closure Rules <validation-"
"using-closure-rule>` (since v4.3.0) or :ref:`Rule Classes <validation-using-"
"rule-classes>` instead."
msgstr ""
"CI4 유효성 검사에는 CI3의 `콜백 "
"<http://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/form_validation.html#callbacks-"
"your-own-validation-methods>`_\\ 이 없습니다. 대신 :ref:`호출 가능 규칙 <validation-"
"using-callable-rule>` (v4.5.0 이후) 또는 :ref:`클로저 규칙 <validation-using-closure-"
"rule>` (v4.3.0 이후) 또는 :ref:`규칙 클래스 <validation-using-rule-classes>`\\ 를 "
"사용하십시오."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_validations.rst:22
msgid ""
"In CI3, Callbacks/Callable rules were prioritized, but in CI4, "
"Closure/Callable Rules are not prioritized, and are checked in the order in "
"which they are listed."
msgstr ""
"CI3에서는 콜백/호출 가능 규칙이 우선시되었지만, CI4에서는 클로저/호출 가능 규칙이 우선시되지 않으며 나열된 순서대로 검사됩니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_validations.rst:24
msgid ""
"Since v4.5.0, :ref:`Callable Rules <validation-using-callable-rule>` has "
"been introduced, but it is a bit different from CI3's `Callable "
"<http://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/form_validation.html#callable-"
"use-anything-as-a-rule>`_."
msgstr ""
"v4.5.0부터 :ref:`호출 가능 규칙 <validation-using-callable-rule>`\\ 이 도입되었지만, CI3의 "
